  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Employment Strategy (YES) implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Youth Employment Strategy (YES) aims to invest in prospects by promoting youth entrepreneurship by boosting sustainable youth employability and entrepreneurship in Nigeria through collaboration. By aligning the various efforts, funded by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands, and identifying synergies, a more comprehensive systemic change can be achieved, benefitting the youth in Nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
